      "content": "I hear how heavy this feels—like your body has become an obstacle instead of an ally, and that isolation is amplifying the pain. You're not \"already gone,\" though; reaching out and naming this honestly is a sign of deep presence, not absence. Could you try a warm compress on your most painful joints and maybe call or text one person today, even just to say hello? You don't have to carry this alone, and sometimes the smallest anchor can steady the ship.",
